---
source: tests/cli_golden.rs
expression: help
---
AURA CLI - Autonomous Universal Reasoning Architecture

Usage: aura [OPTIONS] [COMMAND]

Commands:
  run      Run the agent (default when no subcommand is given)
  login    Sign in to zOS, or link a Claude / ChatGPT plan
  logout   Sign out of zOS, or unlink a plan
  whoami   Show the zOS sign-in and linked plans
  auth     Manage linked plans
  hello    Print "Hello, World!" and exit (Spec 01)
  migrate  Phase 4a stub: migrate aura state (no-op today)
  plugins  Manage declarative plugins (Phase 4b)
  help     Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --mode <MODE>
          Session mode for the interactive terminal. Overrides the daemon default (`AURA_DEFAULT_MODE`); the kernel denies any tool call the mode does not allow

          Possible values:
          - agent: Full unrestricted operation subject to user permissions
          - plan:  Read + markdown writes + read-only subprocesses
          - ask:   Read-only
          - debug: Read + sandboxed probes only

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')
